# Audit finding tags that stay on purpose. One `<path>:<tag>` entry per remaining tag.
# An entry exempts that tag in that file only, so a different tag added to the same file still fails.
# Remove an entry when its tag is gone. The lint reports an entry that matches no tag.

# Three string literals become the notes of exported genotype calls, so rewording them changes exported output.
Sources/LungfishIO/Bundles/GenotypeHaplotypeAnalyzer.swift:GEN-02
Sources/LungfishIO/Bundles/GenotypeHaplotypeAnalyzer.swift:GEN-08

# Bundled script whose SHA-256 is recorded in run provenance, so rewording even a comment changes provenance content.
Sources/LungfishWorkflow/Resources/ONTGenotyping/barcode-demux-filter.py:GEN-01
Sources/LungfishWorkflow/Resources/ONTGenotyping/barcode-demux-filter.py:GEN-04
Sources/LungfishWorkflow/Resources/ONTGenotyping/barcode-demux-filter.py:GEN-09
Sources/LungfishWorkflow/Resources/ONTGenotyping/barcode-demux-filter.py:GEN-12

# A comment inside an embedded fake gh script, which lives in a string literal of the test file.
scripts/tests/test_release_builder_phases.py:REL-05
